    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429200/extras/f5eeb61564d080845b5abf9cba958b38.poster.avif?t=1729355725\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429200/extras/f5eeb61564d080845b5abf9cba958b38.webm?t=1729355725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429200/extras/f5eeb61564d080845b5abf9cba958b38.mp4?t=1729355725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Phil's Contract</strong> is a 2D platformer with fast-paced movement with an emphasis bunny-hopping and beat 'em up-esque combat. Featuring charming, yet grimy pixel art inspired from the likes of flash animations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BORN FOR <strong>BLOOD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a short, stubby cursed office worker from hell who wants nothing but to be free. Being very dissatisfied with his current standing, and having to do the same bullshit menial tasks over and over again, he SNAPS and escapes from hell. Only for his boss to get extremely fucking pissed and putting a curse on where Phil resides, turning everything against him. He must break the curse and destroy the contract in which it all began.. <strong>After all.. You aren't the only Phil in this world</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully animated cutscenes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New movesets to keep the experience fresh and unique as you play as 3 characters throughout the story,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIGHT the characters you play as Phil. Face them to gain their trust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique soundtrack.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429200/extras/f5eeb61564d080845b5abf9cba958b38.poster.avif?t=1729355725\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429200/extras/f5eeb61564d080845b5abf9cba958b38.webm?t=1729355725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429200/extras/f5eeb61564d080845b5abf9cba958b38.mp4?t=1729355725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Phil's Contract</strong> is a 2D platformer with fast-paced movement with an emphasis bunny-hopping and beat 'em up-esque combat. Featuring charming, yet grimy pixel art inspired from the likes of flash animations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BORN FOR <strong>BLOOD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a short, stubby cursed office worker from hell who wants nothing but to be free. Being very dissatisfied with his current standing, and having to do the same bullshit menial tasks over and over again, he SNAPS and escapes from hell. Only for his boss to get extremely fucking pissed and putting a curse on where Phil resides, turning everything against him. He must break the curse and destroy the contract in which it all began.. <strong>After all.. You aren't the only Phil in this world</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully animated cutscenes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New movesets to keep the experience fresh and unique as you play as 3 characters throughout the story,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIGHT the characters you play as Phil. Face them to gain their trust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique soundtrack.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Phil's Contract is a 2D platformer with fast-paced movement, unique movesets and varied gameplay styles. Featuring charming, yet grimy pixel art inspired from the likes of flash animations.",
